EL(q; fixed N_E) / trace-equation = N_E*a_anom*(16*N_E**4*(3*epsilon + 5)*q(t)**2 - 48*N_E**2*Q0**2*(epsilon + 1)*q(t)*Derivative(q(t), (t, 2)) + 48*N_E**2*Q0**2*(epsilon + 1)*Derivative(q(t), t)**2 + 24*N_E**2*Q0**2*q(t)**2*Derivative(q(t), (t, 2)) - 24*N_E**2*Q1**2*(epsilon + 1)*q(t)**2 - 12*Q0**2*epsilon*(Q2**2 + 2*q(t)*Derivative(q(t), (t, 4)) + 4*Derivative(q(t), t)*Derivative(q(t), (t, 3)) + 2*Derivative(q(t), (t, 2))**2)*q(t)**2 + 12*Q0**2*(3*epsilon + 1)*q(t)*Derivative(q(t), t)**2*Derivative(q(t), (t, 2)) - 4*Q0**2*(3*epsilon + 1)*Derivative(q(t), t)**4 + Q1**4*(3*epsilon + 1)*q(t)**2)/(192*pi**2*Q0**2*(4*N_E**4 + 4*N_E**2*epsilon*Derivative(q(t), (t, 2)) - 2*N_E**2*q(t)*Derivative(q(t), (t, 2)) - N_E**2*Derivative(q(t), t)**2 + 4*N_E**2*Derivative(q(t), (t, 2)) + 2*epsilon*q(t)**2*Derivative(q(t), (t, 4)) + 6*epsilon*q(t)*Derivative(q(t), t)*Derivative(q(t), (t, 3)) + 2*epsilon*q(t)*Derivative(q(t), (t, 2))**2 - epsilon*Derivative(q(t), t)**2*Derivative(q(t), (t, 2)) - Derivative(q(t), t)**2*Derivative(q(t), (t, 2)))*q(t))
dL_t/dN_E on the sphere (should vanish identically: regular cap => constraint holds): a_anom*(3*epsilon + (-18*epsilon - 3)*(t*(cos(T) - 1) + 1)**2*((t*cos(T) - t + 1)**2 - 1) + (-9*epsilon - 3)*(t*(cos(T) - 1) + 1)**4 + (6*epsilon + 6)*(t*(cos(T) - 1) + 1)**2 - ((t*cos(T) - t + 1)**2 - 1)*(9*epsilon*((t*cos(T) - t + 1)**2 - 1) - 6*epsilon + 1) + 5)/(8*pi**2*((t*cos(T) - t + 1)**2 - 1))
I(T)/a_anom for the sphere truncated at tau=T: -epsilon*cos(T)**3 + 3*epsilon*cos(T) - 2*epsilon + 5*cos(T)/2 - 5/2
full sphere T=pi: -4*epsilon - 5    half sphere T=pi/2: -2*epsilon - 5/2
